---
import { RATINGS } from "@/lib/leitner";

// The rail beside a flashcard deck: how a round works and its keys.
type Props = { count: number };
const { count } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class="grid gap-6 lg:sticky lg:top-6">
  <div class="flex items-end gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-matcha-300 px-6 pt-6 text-noir">
    <div class="pb-6">
      <p class="text-5xl font-extrabold tabular-nums">{count}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold">kartu di sesi ini</p>
    </div>
    <img src="/ilustrasi/baca.svg" alt="" width="890" height="1220" loading="lazy" class="ml-auto h-36 w-auto" />
  </div>
  <section aria-labelledby="cara-kartu" class="rounded-[28px] bg-zinc-900 p-6 shadow-soft">
    <h2 id="cara-kartu" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Cara pakai</h2>
    <ol class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-noir text-xs font-bold text-on-noir">1</span>Jawab pertanyaannya dalam hati dulu.</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-noir text-xs font-bold text-on-noir">2</span><span>Balik kartu dengan tombol atau <kbd class="rounded-md border border-zinc-700 px-1.5 font-mono text-xs">Space</kbd>.</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-noir text-xs font-bold text-on-noir">3</span><span>Nilai seberapa ingat kamu: {RATINGS.map((r, i) => <span><kbd class="rounded-md border border-zinc-700 px-1.5 font-mono text-xs">{r.rating}</kbd> {r.label}{i < RATINGS.length - 1 ? ", " : "."}</span>)}</span></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mt-4 rounded-2xl bg-matcha-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-noir">Kartu yang kamu lupa muncul lagi besok. Yang sudah bisa, jaraknya makin lama.</p>
  </section>
</aside>
